{[%cal Ge4h7,Ge4a8,Ge4b1,Ge4h1] Moves: Any number of squares diagonally, but
only on one color for the whole game.  When it’s strong:   • Strong in
open positions, where it has long diagonals to move.   • Two bishops
together (the bishop pair) is a strong combination.   • Very useful in
endgames, especially on both sides of the board.  Value: 3 pawns.}  *

